items.source:
A <a href="MongoExpression.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb"><code>MongoExpression</code></a> using the <a href="util/json/ParameterBindingDocumentCodec.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.util.json"><code>ParameterBindingDocumentCodec</code></a> for parsing a raw (json)
expression. The expression will be wrapped within <code>{ ... }</code> if necessary. The actual parsing and parameter
binding of placeholders like <code>?0</code> is delayed upon first call on the target <code>Document</code> via
<a href="#toDocument()"><code>toDocument()</code></a>. <br/>

<pre class="code">$toUpper : $name                -&gt; { '$toUpper' : '$name' }

{ '$toUpper' : '$name' }        -&gt; { '$toUpper' : '$name' }

{ '$toUpper' : '?0' }, "$name"  -&gt; { '$toUpper' : '$name' }
</pre>

Some types might require a special <code>Codec</code>. If so, make sure to provide a <code>CodecRegistry</code>
containing the required <code>codec</code> via <a href="#withCodecRegistry(org.bson.codecs.configuration.CodecRegistry)"><code>withCodecRegistry(CodecRegistry)</code></a>.

items.translation:
使用 <a href="MongoExpression.html" title="interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb"><code>MongoExpression</code></a> 并通过 <a href="util/json/ParameterBindingDocumentCodec.html" title="class in org.springframework.data.mongodb.util.json"><code>ParameterBindingDocumentCodec</code></a> 解析原始（JSON）表达式。如有必要，该表达式将被包裹在 <code>{ ... }</code> 中。对占位符（如 <code>?0</code>）的实际解析和参数绑定会延迟到首次调用目标 <code>Document</code> 的 <a href="#toDocument()"><code>toDocument()</code></a> 方法时进行。<br/>

<pre class="code">$toUpper : $name                -&gt; { '$toUpper' : '$name' }

{ '$toUpper' : '$name' }        -&gt; { '$toUpper' : '$name' }

{ '$toUpper' : '?0' }, "$name"  -&gt; { '$toUpper' : '$name' }
</pre>

某些类型可能需要特殊的 <code>Codec</code>。如果是这样，请确保通过 <a href="#withCodecRegistry(org.bson.codecs.configuration.CodecRegistry)"><code>withCodecRegistry(CodecRegistry)</code></a> 提供一个包含所需 <code>codec</code> 的 <code>CodecRegistry</code>。
